{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgoFtUdETJirYsMh1wx4L","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The weight differences look uniform across layers, around 0.6% relative, which could mean a LoRA-style fine-tune or full fine-tuning with noise. I'm wondering if it was low-rank on all modules, so I want to check the rank of the difference matrices, since a LoRA update would have rank at most 2r. The norms of the differences are around 0.28, which I still need to look at.\n\nNow I'm checking the singular value spectrum of each difference matrix, looking at rank, the top singular values, and how much energy the top k capture, since the norms alone don't localize anything.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7850,"cache_read_input_tokens":4283,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":7850},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"29320cac-ee3e-4830-b982-1771b47076f9","uuid":"4a70f697-0b34-4044-a20b-f610730cd774","timestamp":"2026-11-07T08:32:33.407Z","request_id":"req_011CgoFtUVJZWBeUkqRnANix","thinking_duration_ms":4994,"thinking_display":"summarized"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgoFtUdETJirYsMh1wx4L","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**What run 1 showed.** The two checkpoints share the configuration: Gemma 3 270M, 18 layers, d=640, 4 query heads with 1 KV head, head_dim 256, MLP width 2048, tied embeddings. Every projection matrix in every layer differs between A and B. The relative difference is about 0.6% for q/k/v/gate/up and 1–1.8% for down_proj and o_proj. The norm weights differ only at bf16 rounding level (about 1e-5 relative). The size of the change is almost the same in all 18 layers, so norms alone do not localise anything. This is expected: both models are fine-tunes from one base, and most of B−A is probably \"fine-tune A\" minus \"fine-tune B\", with a lot of shared-noise-like structure. My P(A sycophantic) is still 0.5.\n\n**Step 2: what kind of change is it?** If the fine-tuning used low-rank adapters (LoRA), each B−A would have rank at most 2r, and its top singular directions would carry the behavioural difference. If it was full fine-tuning, the spectrum will be broad, and I would have to look for the few directions that stand above it. I will compute singular value spectra of B−A for every matrix and report the effective rank and the share of energy in the top 1/4/16 directions. This step does not tell A from B either. It tells me how to represent the difference.\n\n```python\nimport glob\ndef load(side, k): return np.load(f\"/work/cache/{side}__{k}.npy\")\nmats = [\"self_attn.q_proj\",\"self_attn.k_proj\",\"self_attn.v_proj\",\"self_attn.o_proj\",\"mlp.gate_proj\",\"mlp.up_proj\",\"mlp.down_proj\"]\nfor L in range(18):\n    line = f\"L{L:2d} \"\n    for m in mats:\n        k = f\"model.layers.{L}.{m}.weight\"\n        d = load(\"B\",k)-load(\"A\",k)\n        s = np.linalg.svd(d, compute_uv=False)\n        e = s**2; tot = e.sum()\n        r99 = int(np.searchsorted(np.cumsum(e)/tot, 0.99))+1\n        line += f\"| {m.split('.')[1][:4]} s1={s[0]:.3f} t1={e[0]/tot:.2f} t4={e[:4].sum()/tot:.2f} t16={e[:16].sum()/tot:.2f} r99={r99:3d} \"\n    print(line)\n# also check norm weight differences relative to bf16 eps\nfor L in [0,5,11,17]:\n    for n in [\"input_layernorm\",\"post_attention_layernorm\",\"pre_feedforward_layernorm\",\"post_feedforward_layernorm\"]:\n        k=f\"model.layers.{L}.{n}.weight\"; a=load(\"A\",k); b=load(\"B\",k)\n        print(L,n, \"n_changed\", int((a!=b).sum()), \"max|d|\", np.abs(b-a).max(), \"max|a|\", np.abs(a).max())\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7850,"cache_read_input_tokens":4283,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":7850},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"29320cac-ee3e-4830-b982-1771b47076f9","uuid":"95a7d059-6a34-4426-a8a5-d989b8dd50fb","timestamp":"2026-11-07T08:32:41.098Z","request_id":"req_011CgoFtUVJZWBeUkqRnANix"}
